},{\"id\":3398788,\"name\":\"Laura Horak\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2180110,\"name\":\"Nils Warnecke\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1274415,\"name\":\"Andrea Weiss\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xMiqJgXXolomP7yD53Z2JzTQGVv.jpg\"},{\"id\":1838350,\"name\":\"Lars-Åke Wilhelmsson\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nMpCgyIClHIiFR6hl9e7DQH3Kkb.jpg\"},{\"id\":3398782,\"name\":\"Jan Göransson\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":69645,\"name\":\"Kjell Bergqvist\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qVEVJIGw8XsjwYjJ2li3naqlGIs.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":396194,\"title\":\"Ennio\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lEuLAubp74HYztEyNYpEx3AoqOu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iytQNneOp4lNSKktRh9T6Fo3UXk.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A portrait of Ennio Morricone, the most popular and prolific film composer of the 20th century, the one most loved by the international public, a two-time Oscar winner and the author of over five hundred unforgettable scores.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":776527,\"title\":\"Summer of Soul (...Or, When the Revolution Could Not Be Televised)\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8kNwhqUGvpzWJd60O1Qvb8G6psK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1LYWnmr5K3Hs3XEZ323bY0dBZsK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the same summer as Woodstock, over 300,000 people attended the Harlem Cultural Festival, celebrating African American music and culture, and promoting Black pride and unity. The footage from the festival sat in a basement, unseen for over 50 years, keeping this incredible event in America's history lost — until now.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":123678,\"title\":\"The Act of Killing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sp5B7Tz5ttsgOLnIlCP5uEhtesI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1jLaJPdu7dMl0Nk3vLuafDx9PWS.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After befriending documentarian Joshua Oppenheimer, former Indonesian death squad leaders reenact their real-life mass killings in the style of various American film genres. As they recreate their past atrocities, the line between reality and performance blurs, exposing the lingering impact of Indonesia's 1965-66 anti-communist purge and the unsettling psychology of its perpetrators.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":549559,\"title\":\"Apollo 11\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/woLMRroHyoTGoXyxdEeBJEYBFtu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/el4j0LHk56uH6ErE5FZu2x5UJx8.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look at the Apollo 11 mission to land on the moon led by commander Neil Armstrong and pilot Buzz Aldrin.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22074,\"title\":\"Capitalism: A Love Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zJBkIPakBXdu3cEgGqKCPHUNXVE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2cBCFvMDLZowXKvMaCGot5dmHUz.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Michael Moore comes home to the issue he's been examining throughout his career: the disastrous impact of corporate dominance on the everyday lives of Americans (and by default, the rest of the world).\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":543580,\"title\":\"They Shall Not Grow Old\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yMGfJeTXUdIjOqjS0jJfjgYEuYC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/94PXfCDB6TrTx1YwuUjzIpVXT2i.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A documentary about World War I with never-before-seen footage to commemorate the centennial of Armistice Day, and the end of the war.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1149947,\"title\":\"To End All War: Oppenheimer & the Atomic Bomb\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xwkYWcs8aypUtk3xDRUh0ndo4GA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wBuMF4MmmF3XDaTpvx3gNWbq0tR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Explore how one man's relentless drive and invention of the atomic bomb changed the nature of war forever, led to the deaths of hundreds of thousands of people and unleashed mass hysteria.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12228,\"title\":\"Inside Deep Throat\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iy96Ud1jpnjOEYiHh2XMooD1PfG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1lXuVrX8ZcQWHc1k192yFSNh1R7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1972, a seemingly typical shoestring budget pornographic film was made in a Florida hotel: \\\"Deep Throat,\\\" starring Linda Lovelace. This film would surpass the wildest expectation of everyone involved to become one of the most successful independent films of all time. It caught the public imagination which met the spirit of the times, even as the self-appointed guardians of public morality struggled to suppress it, and created, for a brief moment, a possible future where sexuality in film had a bold artistic potential. This film covers the story of the making of this controversial film, its stunning success, its hysterical opposition along with its dark side of mob influence and allegations of the on set mistreatment of the film's star.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":377462,\"title\":\"O.J.: Made in America\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nFmg2G4IJ0x9mALXkYFN8Gw0Dw5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a9jBEm8wb4XJIvAdFJlAVgVxbB5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A chronicle of the rise and fall of O.J. Simpson, whose high-profile murder trial exposed the extent of American racial tensions, revealing a fractured and divided nation.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Crime\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":378107,\"title\":\"Another Day of Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eK2VU8VJokGOv1K698eDKRHuzgw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xHUcLw5qCk3642T9sh8J6i4oUCO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1975, Ryszard Kapuściński, a veteran Polish journalist, embarked on a seemingly suicidal road trip into the heart of the Angola's civil war. There, he witnessed once again the dirty reality of war and discovered a sense of helplessness previously unknown to him. Angola changed him forever: it was a reporter who left Poland, but it was a writer who returned…\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":267480,\"title\":\"The Look of Silence\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7TakQLT8gyzIMG8hX8RLTd5qROQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eozLsgdW5VyUEdPDuDaBD4VB86o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An Indonesian man with a communist background named Ramli was brutally murdered when the \\\"Communist\\\" purge occurred in 1965. His remaining family members lived in fear and silence until the making of this documentary. Adi, a brother of his, decided to revisit the horrific incident and visited the men who were responsible for the killings and one survivor of the purge. These meetings uncovered sadistic details of the murders and exposed raw emotions and reactions of the killers' family members about what happened in the past - much to Adi's disappointment.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13016,\"title\":\"Zeitgeist: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4eJQJ3tvnNO7CdxXT5awnd9ovGX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4CLZ8P4kZNBLR06n1NdxxWKnFRp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A documentary examining possible historical and modern conspiracies surrounding Christianity, the 9/11 terrorist attacks, and the Federal Reserve bank.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"wm_bnCHR9ag\",\"name\":\"Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}